          "text": "🚨#BREAKING: Outrage is erupting after a Washington mother wrecked her car, got out and attacked her own CHILDREN WITH A KNIFE...\n\n...then 2 United States SOLDIERS who happened to be passing by jumped out, TACKLED HER TO THE GROUND, AND TOOK THE KNIFE!!!!\n\nThe girls are 9 and 15 years old.\n\nOn Monday morning, just before 9 a.m., she was heading south on I-5 near DuPont.\n\nTroopers say she was driving erratically and she hit the left barrier, swerved across the freeway to the right shoulder, swerved BACK left and slammed into a SEMI TRUCK, and hit the barrier AGAIN.\n\nThen the SUV rolled over MULTIPLE TIMES.\n\nSomehow, all three of them climbed out.\n\nThen, according to witnesses, that's when she pulled a KNIFE on the two girls.\n\nBut two uniformed JBLM soldiers were driving by, they didn't film it, they didn't keep driving.\n\nThey pulled over and RAN TOWARD IT.\n\nThey tackled her to the ground and TOOK THE KNIFE out of her hand.\n\nThe 9-year-old girl was hurt badly, with BROKEN BONES and a ST*B WOUND.\n\nThe 15-year-old thankfully has no serious injuries.\n\nBoth girls are in stable condition.\n\nThank God.\n\nThe WSP sergeant on the case said that if those soldiers hadn't stepped in, \"we can assume the worst.\"\n\nTroopers say she'll be booked on suspicion of DUI, vehicular assault, and FIRST-DEGREE ASSAULT once she's released.\n\nPlease pray for that little girl.\n\nAnd thank God for those two soldiers.\n\nWE DO NOT HAVE TO LIVE LIKE THIS!!!!!!!"
